WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.009 --> 00:00:01.070
The curbside bin

1
00:00:01.370 --> 00:00:03.849
will be placed on the curb by the householder.

2
00:00:04.289 --> 00:00:06.440
It'll then get picked up by the collection vehicle.

3
00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:07.530
It'll go to

4
00:00:08.090 --> 00:00:09.750
usually go to a transfer station,

5
00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:10.510
uh,

6
00:00:10.529 --> 00:00:12.270
that may be operated by council

7
00:00:12.569 --> 00:00:15.560
or that may be operated by a private operator such as Soilco.

8
00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.850
The transfer station aggregates all those different materials coming to that site

9
00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.790
and then it'll go off to a post collection

10
00:00:22.319 --> 00:00:25.129
facility such as a composting site for further processing.

11
00:00:25.739 --> 00:00:29.299
And they may also operated by councils and or private operators,

12
00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:29.930
so there's,

13
00:00:30.399 --> 00:00:30.729
there's

14
00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:32.819
different parts of the collection process where,

15
00:00:32.979 --> 00:00:35.310
where both councils and the private sector are involved.

16
00:00:35.389 --> 00:00:36.330
Organics,

17
00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:39.310
such as food waste and garden waste

18
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:42.049
take up about 50% of our landfill space.

19
00:00:42.470 --> 00:00:44.590
And so not only are they filling up landfills.

20
00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:46.770
They're also a really valuable resource.

21
00:00:47.069 --> 00:00:47.470
Uh,

22
00:00:47.669 --> 00:00:49.880
organics in our landfill create methane,

23
00:00:50.029 --> 00:00:52.380
which is obviously a negative effect to our,

24
00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:53.200
our environment.

25
00:00:53.669 --> 00:00:54.810
So by taking

26
00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.369
that material out of landfill and

27
00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:00.189
making a product that we can actually then put back into our soils,

28
00:01:00.229 --> 00:01:02.549
we are creating a circular environment whereby

29
00:01:02.909 --> 00:01:03.610
we are

30
00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.629
diverting material from landfill,

31
00:01:05.739 --> 00:01:07.089
producing a valuable product,

32
00:01:07.099 --> 00:01:08.370
and improving cell health.